OL,3,GNEWSAChildren cut down on social screen
OL,4,Atime for trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of teenagers have joined a
OL,7,Ftrial to limit their time on social
OL,8,Fmedia as part of a major study.
OL,10,FResearchers at Born in Bradford believe
OL,11,Fthe IRL (In Real Life) trial is the
OL,12,Ffirst major scientific study into the
OL,13,Fimpact of limiting social media on
OL,14,Fyoung people's mental health.
OL,16,FResults from the study will help inform
OL,17,Fhow the government implements a social
OL,18,Fmedia ban for under-16s that was
OL,19,Fannounced in May and would be
OL,20,Fintroduced by spring 2027.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
