OL,3,GNEWSAChildren cut down on social screen
OL,4,Atime for trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring preliminary stages, 200 students
OL,7,Faged 12-15 were asked to limit social
OL,8,Fmedia use, but now the research team
OL,9,Fhas recruited 4,000 students from
OL,10,FBradford secondary schools.
